{"jab":{"id":"16b4acf3-494b-4791-b9c7-ecc4aa897a19","word":"jab","trans":[{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"(boxing) a short straight punch","tags":["masculine"],"word":"direto"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"(boxing) a short straight punch","tags":["masculine"],"word":"cruzado"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"(boxing) a short straight punch","tags":["masculine"],"word":"jab (MMA)"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"medical injection","tags":["feminine"],"word":"injeção"}],"pos":"noun","tags":null,"senses":[{"examples":[{"text":"He tore in for the ball, make a running jab for it and held it.","ref":"1952, Bernard Malamud, The Natural, Chapter 9:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[40,43]],"id":"992bce28-678a-4a6f-81fd-0bf430e99806"}],"links":[["poking","poke"],["thrust","thrust"]],"categories":["English terms with quotations"],"glosses":["A quick stab or blow; a poking or thrusting motion."],"id":"16e2c230-68e8-4495-b236-184bd54822e4"},{"examples":[{"text":"American Ward was too quick and too slick for his British rival, landing at will with razor sharp jabs and hooks and even bullying Froch at times.","ref":"2011 December 18, Ben Dirs, “Carl Froch outclassed by dazzling Andre Ward”, in BBC Sport:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[98,102]],"id":"c7166fb7-21ff-466a-88ae-74ec533e7f80"}],"topics":["boxing","government","hobbies","lifestyle","martial-arts","military","politics","sports","war"],"categories":["English terms with quotations","en:Boxing"],"links":[["boxing","boxing#Noun"]],"raw_glosses":["(boxing) A short straight punch."],"glosses":["A short straight punch."],"id":"f11f75b7-9f35-46c1-ac91-e06254e57da3"},{"examples":[{"text":"Our dog was exposed to rabies, so the whole family went to a clinic to get our jabs.","bold_text_offsets":[[79,83]],"type":"example","id":"40754fd3-f8c7-481d-8714-33e326169edb"}],"categories":["British English","Engl